        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Amy, la niña de la mochila azul\n- People: Danna Paola, Nora Salinas, Eduardo Capetillo, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Tatiana, Alejandro Tommasi, Lorena Herrera, Alejandra Meyer, Alejandra Procuna\n- Companies: Televisa\n\nFacts:\n- Amy, la niña de la mochila azul is a Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa in 2004.\n- Amy, la niña de la mochila azul stars Danna Paola, Nora Salinas, and Eduardo Capetillo.\n- Amy, la niña de la mochila azul features Pedro Armendáriz Jr. and Tatiana as co-protagonists.\n- Amy, la niña de la mochila azul includes Alejandro Tommasi, Lorena Herrera, Alejandra Meyer, and Alejandra Procuna as antagonists.\n- Danna Paola Rivera Munguía was born on 23 June 1995 in Mexico City.\n- Danna Paola Rivera Munguía is better known as Danna Paola.\n- Danna Paola is a Mexican singer, actress, model, fashion designer, and recording artist.",
